Desperate to preserve the song that had thawed his dormant soul, Orok split his own stone chest to swallow the falling light. Deep within his core, these embers fused into a colossal, resonant geode of pulsating amethyst. Though Vael believed silence was restored, Orok refused to surrender. Channeling fierce canyon gales through his crystalline heart, Orok became a living forge of sound. Today, whenever weary travelers call out into the mist, Orok hurls their voices back, eternally broadcasting Aella’s beautiful defiance.

